  {
   "id": "angeline-era-252768@major-2026-04-15",
   "gameId": "angeline-era-252768",
   "displayName": "25% Off! Daily Deal + Localization Update + T-Shirt Merch!!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-15T17:00:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Angeline Era's 25% off - our deepest discount yet - to celebrate our first Daily Deal, as well as some cool updates:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Localization Update",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Angeline Era is finally finished with localizing, bringing the total to eight languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Brazilian Portuguese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "LATAM Spanish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Turkish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "English",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a long road coming but this means we're officially prepared for the console (Switch/PS/Xbox) porting process, which we hope to have news on soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "T-Shirt Merch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Already love Angeline Era? We just released some t-shirts for the game which you can buy here:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44231730/bdbd89586f1b26216aeb369f9415f990e92d6127.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for all your support on Marina and I's games! If you'd like to support us more...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Leave a review for Angeline Era!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For fans of cozier, slice-of-life adventures, wishlist my upcoming game, Danchi Days: [dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3107530/Danchi_Days/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check out our other games: https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/analgesic",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
